      "refersTo": "chapter-cover",
      "description": "Tooled leather cover for the album and each city chapter.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-leather\"><h2>Edinburgh</h2><p>4–5 October</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-leather{position:relative;isolation:isolate;display:grid;place-items:center;gap:.6rem;width:280px;aspect-ratio:3/4;padding:2rem;background:#4a2c1f url(docs/assets/leather.png);background-size:512px;color:#c8a25a;border-radius:5px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 235 200/.08),inset 0 0 40px rgb(0 0 0/.28),0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0/.5),0 22px 50px -18px rgb(0 0 0/.75)}.ds-leather::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:.8rem;border:1px solid rgb(200 162 90/.6)}.ds-leather h2{margin:0;font:400 1.6rem/1.1 Marcellus,Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;text-shadow:0 1px 0 rgb(0 0 0/.45)}.ds-leather p{margin:0;font:400 .9rem \"Alegreya Sans SC\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#d9bf86}"
    },
    {
